This repository distributes a modified build of the DataLens UI (a
"distribution", not the upstream source tree). Modifications made by the
fork maintainers include:

  - Theme Studio: theme model, editor, Gravity UI theme importer/exporter,
    preview, gallery, per-user theme assignment, applier at UI startup;
  - server-side JSON theme store and /api/themes* routes;
  - light/dark/high-contrast (four-variant) theme variable generation and
    dashboard border-radius propagation;
  - client-side batch and NDJSON streaming chart loading with fallback,
    request coalescing and entry/JS prefetch;
  - the nginx routing for /api/run, /api/run/batch and
    /api/run/batch/stream to the Rust monolith.

